  "pages": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/8025.png",
      "text": "Ka letsatsi le leng, 'm'e o ile a reka litholoana ka mefuta-futa.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36352#page=1",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:a6d34bfcd3964ffa3760be15b983ba277f1046e37f5069df808bfc349256dac8"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/8032.png",
      "text": "\"Re tla ja litholoana neng?\" ra botsa 'm'e. \"Re tla ja litholoana mantsiboeng ana,\" ho rialo 'm'e.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36352#page=2",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:af2c5fa84894d3239ba2f2dff1acbc0494ef1993993ac46a159b85c2ac6711c8"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/8029.png",
      "text": "Moena oa ka Thabo o meharo. O ile a latsoa litholoana tsohle. A li ja haholo.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36352#page=3",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:c5ca4bc162c71507dec85cf6cc6fa0b2c32a92d6cfc34399f2db777437480bf9"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/8027.png",
      "text": "\"Bona seo Thabo a se entseng!\" ho hoeletsa ngoan'eso e monyane oa moshanyana. Ka re: \"Thabo o setoutu ebile o nahanela eena feela.\"",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36352#page=4",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:82f4a25ee3e94dc25dd214ae174783a607df65a17dea9e8750bc2470d8fc2520"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/8023.png",
      "text": "'M'e o ne a halefetse Thabo haholo.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36352#page=5",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:b6f2cb44089fdb7f0d26d1f48d2bd22a7d9912bc4145dc4ccc742e8e6f657c71"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/8024.png",
      "text": "Le rona re ne re halefetse Thabo haholo. Empa Thabo ha a ka a soabela seo a se entseng.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36352#page=6",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:8b2ae25114775baa41bc8934531e5db322aa93a76348abfcb3a45079ad67fe2b"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/8030.png",
      "text": "\"Na u tlo fa Thabo kotlo 'm'e?\" ha botsa ngoan'eso e monyane oa moshanyana.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36352#page=7",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:bd272c0a816e66316ea8c2b24a132a21af77f8ee676018cb440691f4ecf5ebb1"
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/8033.png",
      "text": "\"Thabo, u tlo soaba,\" 'me oa hae, o oa hlokomelisa.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36352#page=8",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:da98a2963467d7a749ddc6c10c1290cb452d22d01bb6d4235429dba9b8f084f4"
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/8031.png",
      "text": "Thabo a qala ho utloa a kula.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36352#page=9",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:211decafb2bc3e3fef888c91d44f056abc1d43f57b620f0bf6f87dd3a7e8c9a1"
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/8034.png",
      "text": "\"Ke ts'oeroe ke mala,\" ho cho Thabo.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36352#page=10",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:ac0c2f944a39c2b578904380a572e23c05a3d0c5f7095cc9e24d8840d2ed9ce8"
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/8035.png",
      "text": "'M'e o ne a tseba hore na hobaneng Thabo a kula. \"Thabo o kulisoa ke litholoana,\" a nahana.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36352#page=11",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:808460c97b9341c442680e789f64122def605af3e64307ade1276b90fb7f4fef"
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "img": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/illustrations/pages/8036.png",
      "text": "Hamorao, Thabo o ile a kopa ts'oarelo ho rona. A re ts'episa a re: \"Ha ke sa tla hlola ke ba meharo.\" Re ile ra mo kholoa.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=36352#page=12",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:95a436ac0f1047bdecfe8167cc399c2ce06e0d621db409d76fe8567983e5f252"
    }
  ],
